      "text": "RTL performance erratum in the Apple M3 Neural Engine throttles DRAM weight streaming throughput down to 17–19 GB&#x2F;s from the nominal 45–60 GB&#x2F;s. Avoiding the problematic path in the kernel DMA engine&#x27;s speculative prefetch ring increased Llama 3.2 1B token throughput from 10.0 to 24.3 tokens&#x2F;s."
    },
